<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Northern Fury 32 - Sneak &amp; Peek, 1994</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Northern Fury&amp;nbsp;32&lt;/STRONG&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;-&amp;nbsp;Sneak &amp;amp; Peek&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;10 March 1994, 2000 Zulu, 2100 Local&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;The new global war between East and West has been raging for a month, NATO is on the offensive but the Warsaw Pact is far from defeated and still has the ability to counter attack.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;The ground war in Europe continues to be brutal and deadly, after Berlin and Copenhagen fell, the Danish Government collapsed but the Germans continue to govern out of Bonn. Danish air and naval forces are generally still fighting alongside NATO counterparts but they have taken heavy casualties. Aircraft losses in central Europe count in the thousands, troops in the tens of thousands on both sides. Over 100 ships and patrol vessels have been sunk in the Baltic alone. Conflicts in the Caribbean, Mediterranean, Persian Gulf and Indian Ocean have stabilized in NATO’s favour, both the Panama and Suez Canals remain open and navigable. In the Pacific, 7&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet has opened a corridor to Japan through the Philippines and Taiwan, it is tenuous but holding.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;South Korea is still under constant air threat but some supply and reinforcements, heavily escorted have reached Busan.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS Constellation has retired to San Diego after sustaining heavy losses amongst her air group, which is now operating out of Clark Field.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;USS New Jersey was struck by 3 torpedoes but limped to Manila where it remains tied up, unlikely to put to sea again.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (STRIKFLTLANT) is now in the second phase of its counter attack in the Atlantic.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;Fighting on Iceland continues but 2 MEF believes that they will have the island clear within the week. A massive NATO attack two days ago halted Soviet plans to seize Oslo &lt;/SPAN&gt;but with Berlin and Copenhagen in Russian hands, the situation is not yet assured.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;While a surprise renewal of the Soviet offensive south of Trondheim has begun, Soviet supply lines are becoming stretched. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This scenario is playable by NATO only:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;As the Soviet ground and air campaign moves south, consuming massive amounts of supplies and resources, the Rear Services group for Archangel Corps struggles to keep pace.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;For much of Norway’s coastline there is a single two lane road connecting from the Arctic border near Murmansk all the way to Trondheim, over 2000 Km including an 8Km ferry SW of Narvik. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;In order to speed the delivery of supplies, coastal shipping is in fairly heavy usage. But that is vulnerable – and your job is to prove just how vulnerable that is.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;----------------------------------------------&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;Designer’s Notes:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=standard style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;This is the 32nd scenario of a 58 scenario campaign. See the Northern Fury background document for further insight on the background and happenings so far. The key nuggets&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;Cold War continued, no thaw in relations. WP still alive and doing very well. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.15pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Symbol"&gt;· &lt;/SPAN&gt;The 3&lt;SUP&gt;rd&lt;/SUP&gt; World war started 13 Feb. The Warsaw Pact forces led by the Soviet Union attacked NATO and other nations on a global scale. The main blow was in Western Europe but fighting erupted in the Pacific, Caribbean, Middle East and North Africa.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;India has declared a separate war with Pakistan, North Korea attacked Southwards in an apparently independent move and Argentina is threatening the Falklands again (but has not attacked).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;In earlier scenarios to this battle set, you found that the defences in North Norway have collapsed; the Soviet Northern Fleet has put to sea; and Soviet submarines are inflicting damage along the US Eastern seaboard. Iceland is now in Soviet hands, and an attempt has been made to interdict the Sea and Air Lines of Communications between North America and Europe. The 2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet (US) and &lt;SPAN lang=EN style="mso-ansi-language: EN"&gt;Strike Fleet Atlantic (2&lt;SUP&gt;nd&lt;/SUP&gt; Fleet + NATO forces) heavily supported by USAF and RAF elements have largely retaken Iceland. The fighting in Norway has been stagnating but events over the past 24 hours are indicating a renewed with a Soviet push toward Oslo.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=textbody style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.85pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: OpenSymbol; mso-fareast-font-family: OpenSymbol; mso-bidi-font-family: OpenSymbol"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;•&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Points are allotted or deducted for losses, you only have one unit – if you’re sunk, well, your sunk &lt;SPAN style='FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: Wingdings'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-char-type: symbol; mso-symbol-font-family: Wingdings"&gt;J&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Textbody0 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 6pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'&gt;Created by Bart Gauvin: AKA Gunner98&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
